dialogue is: {{ [doctor] okay, susan, how are you doing today?
[patient] i'm doing okay.
[doctor] good. i'm glad to hear that. so i know that you're here today to get a blood pressure check. how has your blood pressure been lately?
[patient] it's been really high.
[doctor] okay. and you've been taking your norvasc?
[patient] yes, i have.
[doctor] okay. and how often are you taking it?
[patient] every day.
[doctor] okay. and how high has your blood pressure been?
[patient] it's been over 150.
[doctor] okay. and are you experiencing any symptoms? do you have any headaches or shortness of breath or chest pain?
[patient] i've had some headaches.
[doctor] okay. and have you had any chest pain or shortness of breath?
[patient] no.
[doctor] okay. good. you had a kidney transplant a few years ago. how's everything going with that?
[patient] everything's going good.
