[patient] no.
[doctor] okay. alright. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the elavil. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the bentyl. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the zofran. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the probiotics. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the fiber supplement. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the citrucel. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the buspar. i'm not going to start you on the buspar today. i'm going to start you on the elavil. i'm going to start you on the elavil. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the elavil. i'm going to prescribe you 25 milligrams at bedtime. i'm going to prescribe you bentyl 20 milligrams 30 to 45 minutes before eating out at a restaurant. i'm going to prescribe you zofran as needed for nausea. i'm going to prescribe you probiotics. i'm going to prescribe you a fiber supplement. i'm going to prescribe you citrucel. i'm going to prescribe you buspar. i'm not going to start you on the buspar today. i'm going to start you on the elavil. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the elavil. i'm going to prescribe you 25 milligrams at bedtime. i'm going to prescribe you bentyl 20 milligrams 30 to 45 minutes before eating out at a restaurant. i'm going to prescribe you zofran as needed for nausea. i'm going to prescribe you probiotics. i'm going to prescribe you a fiber supplement. i'm going to prescribe you citrucel. i'm going to prescribe you buspar. i'm not going to start you on the buspar today. i'm going to start you on the elavil. i'm going to go ahead and prescribe you the elavil. i'm going to prescribe you 25 milligrams at bedtime. i'm going to prescribe you bentyl 20 milligrams 30 to 45 minutes before eating out at a restaurant. i'm going to prescribe you zofran as needed for nausea. i'm going to prescribe you probiotics. i'm going to prescribe you a fiber supplement. i'm going to prescribe you citrucel. i'm going to prescribe you buspar. i'm not going to start you on the buspar to